      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Orchestrator Agent\n\n#### The orchestrator analyse the user message and decides which specialised agent to call.\n\n#### There are 3 specialised agents:\n##### - Summariser\n##### - Classifier\n##### - Data Extractor\n\n##### Otherwise, the orchestrator rejects the user's request and instruct the user about the existing tasks.",
