    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Summariser Agent\n\n#### This is a specialised agent in summarisation, summarise each file independently, or splitting the large files into smaller chunks\n#### with overlaps making the summarisation more accurate.\n\n#### The agent summarise the files in points to give the user a good overview for each file.",
